# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies — reinstallable from package.json, never committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
Native/**/node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Confidential business documents.
# These are deliberately excluded so that this repository stays safe to push,
# make public, or share with a collaborator without a separate review step.
# If any of these ever need version control, they belong in a private repo of
# their own — not alongside the website.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pptx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working files, not part of the deployable site
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
screen shots/
site.backup/
*.bak
*.html.bak

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows / editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Redundant archive — the same source is unpacked alongside it
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-local tool settings (launch.json IS tracked; local overrides are not)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Firebase config. Required at build time by the com.google.gms.google-services
# gradle plugin, but not committed — so that swapping the current placeholder
# for a real project does not push live keys by accident.
# Copy google-services.json.example to google-services.json to build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
google-services.json
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept out of this repository — it is public, and this repo is the website.
#
#   Native/           React Native app source: core product IP
#   _parked/          shelved product concepts and positioning work
#   image-prompts.md  creative brief and art-direction review notes
#
# raw/ IS tracked: the source photography is the site's own artwork and is
# worth versioning alongside it.
#
# All three remain on disk locally. If any needs version control, it belongs
# in a private repository of its own.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Native/
_parked/
image-prompts.md
